    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Escape is impossible... or is it possible?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A space prison, endless corridors, deadly traps and an all-seeing artificial intelligence ready to tear you apart. You are the last prisoner awakened from a corrective cryo-sleep, your task is to escape from this hell and find out where is everyone else? The only way to escape is to manipulate gravity and adapt to the chaos around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Prisoner</strong> is a hardcore platformer with gravity changing mechanics, an engaging story, and memorable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's in store for you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Changing Mechanics:</strong> Bypass traps by changing the direction of gravity, dodge deadly AI tricks and blast through levels.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341150/extras/2fd431065b0bba2cd805a24ba1ebfc8e.poster.avif?t=1752070241\" width=606 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341150/extras/2fd431065b0bba2cd805a24ba1ebfc8e.webm?t=1752070241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341150/extras/2fd431065b0bba2cd805a24ba1ebfc8e.mp4?t=1752070241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High difficulty for real hardcore gamers:</strong> Each level is a new challenge that requires lightning-fast reactions and precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging story and charismatic characters:</strong> Uncover the truth about humanity\u2019s fate while facing a devious AI and meeting a mysterious ally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An AI determined to destroy you:</strong> The merciless AI will do everything to stop your escape, activating traps at the most unexpected moments. But don\u2019t think she\u2019s just a regular opponent. She won\u2019t just try to kill you\u2014she\u2019ll mock your failures with sarcasm and playful taunts. Get ready for her sharp and cheeky remarks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341150/extras/c490efcd45a36de7a14c139999c6ce86.poster.avif?t=1752070241\" width=769 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341150/extras/c490efcd45a36de7a14c139999c6ce86.webm?t=1752070241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An exhilarating electronic soundtrack:</strong> Powerful tracks that immerse you in the atmosphere and pump adrenaline into your every step.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Escape is impossible... or is it possible?&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A space prison, endless corridors, deadly traps and an all-seeing artificial intelligence ready to tear you apart. You are the last prisoner awakened from a corrective cryo-sleep, your task is to escape from this hell and find out where is everyone else? The only way to escape is to manipulate gravity and adapt to the chaos around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Last Prisoner</strong> is a hardcore platformer with gravity changing mechanics, an engaging story, and memorable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's in store for you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravity Changing Mechanics:</strong> Bypass traps by changing the direction of gravity, dodge deadly AI tricks and blast through levels.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341150/extras/2fd431065b0bba2cd805a24ba1ebfc8e.poster.avif?t=1752070241\" width=606 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341150/extras/2fd431065b0bba2cd805a24ba1ebfc8e.webm?t=1752070241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341150/extras/2fd431065b0bba2cd805a24ba1ebfc8e.mp4?t=1752070241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High difficulty for real hardcore gamers:</strong> Each level is a new challenge that requires lightning-fast reactions and precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging story and charismatic characters:</strong> Uncover the truth about humanity\u2019s fate while facing a devious AI and meeting a mysterious ally.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An AI determined to destroy you:</strong> The merciless AI will do everything to stop your escape, activating traps at the most unexpected moments. But don\u2019t think she\u2019s just a regular opponent. She won\u2019t just try to kill you\u2014she\u2019ll mock your failures with sarcasm and playful taunts. Get ready for her sharp and cheeky remarks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341150/extras/c490efcd45a36de7a14c139999c6ce86.poster.avif?t=1752070241\" width=769 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341150/extras/c490efcd45a36de7a14c139999c6ce86.webm?t=1752070241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An exhilarating electronic soundtrack:</strong> Powerful tracks that immerse you in the atmosphere and pump adrenaline into your every step.</p></li></ul>",
